<FONT SIZE="3"><B>Better late than later...</B></FONT><BR><BR>

- Dantes informed the guild he would be away for most of this week. He is travelling in RL and away from a computer. He asked we keep him in out thoughts during this difficult time for him :) Just joking.
<p>
- Dantes went over the poll results from last week. Many members wanted more raids and roleplaying. We'll try to get more things organized along those lines, but remember that it is your guild, so organize something yourself, don't rely on others to do it.
<p>
- New recruits were welcomed into the guild. Neeily, a  halfling rogue, Alren, a half elf rogue, and Laizze, high elf enchanter.
<p> 
- Angelous gave an update on his search for his lost cousin Wykin and asked for assistance in the form of roleplaying and prizes for player run quests.
<p>
- Raids and quests are planned for the coming week. Check the message board in the members section for details.

